Fix PDF extraction, source attribution, and market data display

Root causes found and fixed:
1. pdfjs-dist static import crashed server at startup (no logs, silent fail)
   → Replaced with Gemini's native PDF understanding (inline base64 PDF input)
   → No external PDF library dependencies anymore

2. Source attribution: images always competed with PDF content
   → imageResultsForAI = [] when pdfResults.length > 0 (physical exclusion)
   → Gemini prompt now inlines exact filename: "**Source:** agri_ai_testing_document.pdf"
   → Server-side fallback appends Source line if Gemini omits it

3. Market data card shown for wrong queries
   → PRICE_KEYWORDS now catches plurals (prices, costs, rates) and inr
   → UI hasRealData also requires pdfResults.length === 0 && imageResults.length === 0
   → Market card hidden whenever doc or image answered the question

4. Image Analysis card shown even when PDF answered
   → Response payload sends imageResultsForAI (not imageResults)
   → Card only appears when images were actually used by the AI

Cache bumped to v9, all stale entries cleared.
